  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creative Caribbean: An Ecosystem of &apos;Play&apos; for Growth and Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action aims to foster economic, human and social development of the Caribbean region by stimulating inclusive, diversified and sustainable growth of the cultural economy through (1) creation of jobs for women, men and youth within a decent work framework; (2) creation, production and distribution of cultural and creative goods and services; (3) improved market access; and (4) support of regional and national policies and measures.</narrative>
  </description>
